  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fields the mart has been supplying that the models were not reading, and the registration details extension.\n\t\t  - Patient and Location: the address lines are named for the keys the mart sends, so both resources carry an address. Neither carried one before.\n\t\t  - Patient: the city is carried onto the address.\n\t\t  - Patient: the CareConnect registration details extension carries the registration period, which DDS returns on every patient.\n\t\t  - Immunization: the description is named for the key the variant sends, so the vaccine's name reaches the resource.",
